{"version": 2, "width": 80, "height": 24, "timestamp": 1786994017, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "linux"}, "title": "trace2eval: traces -> eval.jsonl + coverage map"}
[0.008075, "o", "$ npx trace2eval test/fixtures/sample-traces.json -o eval.jsonl --coverage coverage.json\r\n"]
[0.668733, "o", "trace2eval v0.1.0 → eval.jsonl\r\ncases: 5  (from 9 GenAI spans / 10 total; 1 duplicate removed, 1 incomplete, 1 errored skipped)\r\nscrubbed: 6 PII/secret values in 1 case (API_KEY:1 CREDIT_CARD:1 EMAIL:2 IP:1 PHONE:1)\r\nmodels: gpt-4o:3 gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18:1 claude-sonnet-4-5:1\r\ntools: 1 case(s) with tool activity (get_weather:2)\r\n"]
[2.673699, "o", "# one case had real PII in it -- see the stable typed placeholders:\r\n"]
[3.675801, "o", "$ jq 'select(.meta.scrubbed) | {input, expected, scrubbed: .meta.scrubbed}' eval.jsonl\r\n"]
[4.281118, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"input\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{\r\n    \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"messages\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m[\r\n      \u001b[1;39m{\r\n        \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"role\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"user\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n        \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"content\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"My email is <EMAIL_1> and my phone is <PHONE_1>. My card <CREDIT_CARD_1> was charged twice. Our server <IP_1> logs show token <API_KEY_1> was used.\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\r\n      \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m]\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\r\n  \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"expected\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{\r\n    \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"role\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"assistant\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n    \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"content\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"I've flagged the duplicate charge and sent a confirmation to <EMAIL_1>.\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\r\n  \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"scrubbed\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{\r\n    \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"API_KEY\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m1\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n    \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"CREDIT_CARD\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m1\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n    \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"EMAIL\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m2\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n    \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"IP\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m1\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n    \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"PHONE\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;39m1\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\r\n  \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.783492, "o", "# and the coverage map shows what the eval set covers -- and what it doesn't:\r\n"]
[7.785839, "o", "$ jq . coverage.json\r\n"]
